          "content": "Keeps the accordion. Running call expands to Plan (with pause/stop) + a trace of tool calls showing inputs and outputs. Hover any step to leave a note; the agent replies in the thread. Composer at the bottom steers the whole run from the next step onward. Least disruptive to ship.",
